 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Ask the price",
   "texto": [
    "**Quanto costa?** for one thing and **Quanto costano?** for several: **Quanto costa questo vestito?**, **Quanto costano queste scarpe?**",
    "**Troppo** in front of an adjective is «too much» and does not change: **troppo caro**, **troppo piccola**.",
    "**Caro** is «caro»; otherwise, **economico**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "In the store",
   "texto": [
    "**Posso provare?** = Can I try it on?",
    "**La taglia** is the size of the clothes; for the shoes it is said **il numero**.",
    "In **Lo prendo**, **lo** replaces **il vestito**; in **La prendo**, **la** replaces **la giacca**. The direct pronoun goes before the verb. In plural: **li prendo**, **le prendo**.",
    "To pay: **con la carta** (card) or **in contanti** (cash)."
   ]
  },
